rements.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "QC is an LLM-judge restricted to a context envelope (output artifact + acceptance criteria + declared inputs) so it never sees the stage's prompt, reasoning, or prior verdicts; the Stage (not QC) accumulates prior critiques across retries to avoid oscillating failures. Verdict shaped as score+critique rather than plain pass/fail so retries have something to act on."}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_artifact", "label": "Artifact (requirements)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_budget_ledger", "label": "Budget Ledger (requirements)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_reserve_then_reconcile", "label": "Reserve-then-reconcile budget model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a78.3, \u00a719", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Recommended over pure post-hoc tracking because fan-out concurrency creates overshoot risk: reserving estimated cost before submission and truing up on completion prevents parallel calls from collectively exceeding budget before any single check fires."}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_fan_out", "label": "Fan-Out", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_run_state_machine", "label": "Run Lifecycle State Machine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a79", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_dependency_graph_invalidation", "label": "Dependency Graph & Invalidation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_stale_artifact", "label": "Stale Artifact / soft-delete GC", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.9.2-3, \u00a719", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Artifacts are never hard-deleted; only blobs of stale artifacts are GC-eligible after a retention window, to preserve the audit/improve-the-blueprint goal while still reclaiming storage."}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_provider_adapter_contract", "label": "Provider Adapter Contract", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a716", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_async_job_lifecycle", "label": "Async job lifecycle (estimate\u2192submit\u2192poll\u2192fetch\u2192cancel)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ai-reel-engine-requirements.md", "source_location": "\u00a72.5.4, \u00a719", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Assumed shaped around async lifecycle rather than a flat synchronous call, since video/audio generation cannot be expressed as a fast synchronous call; lets text, image, video, and audio providers share one execution model despite different latencies."}, {"id": "ai_reel_engine_requirements_config_inheritance", "label": "Config Inheritance (Channel\u2192Blueprint\u219